# 统一按 LF 存储，避免 Windows/Linux 混用产生整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.zip binary

# 插件市场按仓库 zip 分发（16MB 上限），开发用文件不随包发出
/tests export-ignore
/tools export-ignore
/ARCHITECTURE.md export-ignore
/PLUGIN_USAGE.md export-ignore
/.github export-ignore
/.gitignore export-ignore
